---
import LaunchLink from "./LaunchLink.astro";
import ProductFolder from "./ProductFolder.astro";
---

<section id="home" class="hero">
  <h1>Get Paid. Pay Out<br />From Any Chain</h1>
  <ProductFolder />
  <p>Remittance for open worlds. Payments infrastructure on NEAR. Invoices, payment links and a checkout API that accept any token on any chain, plus payouts and payroll to any chain. Everything settles in USDC, signed with a passkey, with no gas.</p>
  <LaunchLink class="light-button">Open an account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></LaunchLink>
</section>
